# Secrets & credentials — never commit
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/*secret*
**/*secrets*
**/*credential*
**/*credentials*
**/*token*.json
**/*tokens*.json
**/oauth-tokens*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*
.my.cnf
**/.my.cnf

# Broker auth stores (keep source code; block key/token files)
**/rh_oauth*
**/rh-oauth*
**/alpaca*key*
**/ALPACA*
!**/alpaca*.ts
!**/alpaca*.js
!**/alpaca*.md
!**/alpaca*.tsx

# Allow OAuth *provider* source; block token dumps
!**/oauth*.ts
!**/oauth*.js
!**/oauth*.tsx
!**/oauth*.md

# Allow broker adapter source under backend/src
!backend/src/rh/**
!backend/src/brokers/**

# Local personal / machine paths & notes
**/personal/
**/*private*
**/.cursor/
**/.vscode/settings.json
**/*.local
**/*.local.*
notes/personal/
notes/desk/*private*
.claude/
scratch/

# Runtime / build
node_modules/
dist/
frontend/dist/
backend/dist/
*.log
logs/
tmp/
.DS_Store
coverage/
.cache/
.vite/
*.tsbuildinfo
backend/data/
db/backups/
*.sql
!db/schema.sql
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db
*.dump
*.bak
*.orig
*.har
.npmrc
target/
app-native/src-tauri/target/
app-native/src-tauri/gen/
**/*.app
**/*.dmg
